{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGirl of the Ruins\u201d is a horror-mystery adventure game set in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a girl who looks exactly like you appears and suddenly asks to swap bodies for a few days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swayed by her sweet promise of salvation, you impulsively agree to her proposal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you after this\u2014will it be a sweet salvation, or a horrifying truth and memories you wish you could forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039450/extras/5cec02541e2a5be6c62d066a5632393d.avif?t=1764769044\" width=558 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player game supporting Korean subtitles and interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game with puzzles and mini-games of moderate difficulty, as well as unique quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game based on RPG Maker; explore new locations and gather clues and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various NPCs and gradually uncover the mysterious truths that unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039450?t=1764769044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039450?t=1764769044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039450/0b9a55f60d32497265c1cdc04ee8cb8a90df5ab1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764769044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039450/0b9a55f60d32497265c1cdc04ee8cb8a90df5ab1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764769044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4039560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGirl of the Ruins\u201d is a horror-mystery adventure game set in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a girl who looks exactly like you appears and suddenly asks to swap bodies for a few days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swayed by her sweet promise of salvation, you impulsively agree to her proposal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what awaits you after this\u2014will it be a sweet salvation, or a horrifying truth and memories you wish you could forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039450/extras/5cec02541e2a5be6c62d066a5632393d.avif?t=1764769044\" width=558 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player game supporting Korean subtitles and interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game with puzzles and mini-games of moderate difficulty, as well as unique quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game based on RPG Maker; explore new locations and gather clues and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various NPCs and gradually uncover the mysterious truths that unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Fireworks"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039450/1bfd8